I'm sorry. I'm not entirely sure what "scale indeterminacy" means. Do I need to priors for both X and X_unit trace?

parameters{
  matrix[dimensions] X;
}
transformed parameters{
   cov_matrix[dimensions] X_unitTrace;
   real traceX;

   traceX<-trace(X);
   X_unitTrace<-multiply(1/traceX,X);
}
model{
X~wishart(nu,Sigma2); #nu and Sigma2 are constants and Sigma2 is the Identity matrix

